  "steps": [
    "Rinse all five dals together and soak for 30 minutes, then pressure-cook with turmeric, salt and 4 cups of water for 5 whistles.",
    "Mash the cooked dal lightly with a whisk and keep it warm, adding hot water if too thick.",
    "Heat the ghee in a pan, add cumin seeds, hing, dried red chilli, cinnamon and cloves, and let them sizzle for 15 seconds.",
    "Add the onion and cook until golden, then add ginger paste and tomato and cook until the tomato turns pulpy.",
    "Stir in chilli powder and coriander powder, then pour in the dal and mix well.",
    "Simmer for 8-10 minutes, check salt, and finish with coriander leaves."
  ]
